1
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:10,190
(Raj:)Water Demon.

2
00:00:12,010 --> 00:00:13,500
(Howard:)Ice Dragon.

3
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:17,670
(Leonard:)Lesser Warlord
of Ka'a.

4
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:20,700
(Sheldon:)Not so fast.

5
00:00:20,710 --> 00:00:22,470
(Sheldon:)Infinite Sheldon.

6
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:25,610
(Leonard:)Infinite Sheldon?

7
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:28,310
(Sheldon:)Yes, Infinite Sheldon
defeats all other cards

8
00:00:28,310 --> 00:00:30,900
(Sheldon:)and does not violate the
rule against homemade cards

9
00:00:30,900 --> 00:00:32,820
(Sheldon:)because I made
it at work.

10
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:37,650
(Leonard:)Do you understand why people
don't want to play with you?

11
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:39,260
(Sheldon:)No...

12
00:00:39,260 --> 00:00:42,690
(Sheldon:)although it's a question I've
been pondering since preschool.

13
00:00:43,710 --> 00:00:47,460
(Leonard:)Hey.

14
00:00:47,470 --> 00:00:49,420
Hey, your copy of Science
magazine was in my mailbox.

15
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,340
- Oh, thanks.
- Mm-hmm.

16
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:53,570
(Zack:)Check it out--
all about planets this month.

17
00:00:53,570 --> 00:00:55,610
(Leonard:)That's an atom.

18
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:59,080
(Zack:)Agree to disagree.

19
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:01,450
(Zack:)That's what I love
about science--

